{
  "title": "Yellow Browned Venezuelan Beef Stew",
  "description": "A rich and chewy Venezuelan dish featuring dark brown sugar and beurre-monte, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This ayurvedic-rajasic-friendly recipe is cooked to perfection in a kadhai.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
  "diet": [
